error[E0321]: bad `lugha.toml` line: the path of `geo` must be one double-quoted string
  --> lugha.toml:2:1
  |
2 | geo = libs/geo
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a manifest holds `[packages]` with lines like `geo = "libs/geo"` or `geo = { path = "libs/geo", version = "1.2" }`, and `[package]` with `version = "1.4.0"`

